cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Hydra-Oracle: tennis ATP value-betting research (post-mortem release)"
message: "If you use this code or its data pipeline, cite the repository."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Schiona
    given-names: Pietro
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-23
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/pietroschiona/trading_alpha_tennis"
abstract: >-
  A leak-free walk-forward pipeline for ATP match prediction and betting
  simulation. The release documents a data-leakage post-mortem: the historical
  63% win rate was an artifact of a defective odds-to-match merge, and the
  repaired system shows no demonstrated edge over the market.
keywords:
  - tennis
  - sports betting
  - machine learning
  - data leakage
  - walk-forward validation
